# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  sNuse ships to buyers, so this file assumes the worst case:
#  the working copy has been pointed at a real phone and a real
#  inbox. Anything that could carry a credential, an ADB key, a
#  session, or a person's message text is ignored by default.
#
#  Runtime artifacts deliberately live OUTSIDE the repo, in
#  ~/.android-driver/ (config.json, state/, shots/, last-ui.json),
#  so a normal run never dirties this tree at all.
#
#  Note: .gitignore does NOT remove anything already committed.
#  History is the actual guarantee — this repo is one squashed
#  commit, created from a tree that was swept before it was made.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Credentials and keys ─────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.cer
*.crt
secrets.*
*secret*
credential*
*credential*
creds*
*creds*
login.json
accounts.json
passwords*
*.kdbx
*.1pux
credentials*
client_secret*.json
service-account*.json
token
token.*
*.token
*_token
auth.json
*.session
session.json
.netrc
.msmtprc
cookies.txt
*.cookie

# ── adb: the private key is full shell access to a phone ─────
.android/
adbkey
adbkey.pub
adb_known_hosts*
known_hosts

# ── SSH ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ssh/
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.ppk

# ── Tailscale and other network credentials ──────────────────
# auth keys look like tskey-auth-…; node state carries the private key
tskey*
*.tskey
tailscale*.json
tailscaled.state
*.tsnet*

# ── Polar / storefront ───────────────────────────────────────
polar_token
polar_oat_*
.config/polar/
.config/gh/
.config/snail3d/

# ── Phone and messaging state ────────────────────────────────
# the ledger holds buyer names, message text and replies
config.json
state/
last-ui.json
dumps/
snapshots/
*.uix
*.xml
*.apk

# ── Snapshots: a phone screenshot is message text ────────────
shots/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.heic

# ── Logs and crash output ────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
*.crash
core

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.python-version

# ── Editors and OS ───────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*.bak.*